# Project Structure Guide

- `internal/provider`: Terraform provider implementation, example resource/data source, embedded docs, and tests.
- `internal/your_service`: YOUR_SERVICE placeholder API client package (rename when adapting this template).
- `examples`: Terraform examples used by documentation generation.
- `docs`: Provider documentation.
- `tools`: Go tool dependency tracking.
- `main.go`: Provider server entry point.
- `go.mod` and `go.sum`: Go module and dependency metadata.
- `.github`: CI and release workflows.
- `.trunk`: Tooling configuration.

Keep this repository generic until it is adapted for a concrete provider.
